msgctxt "L_LEE_004"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_005"
msgid "Disable shield system\n"
msgstr "Annuler le système de bouclier\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_006"
msgid "Open hangar doors\n"
msgstr "Ouvrir les portes du hangar\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_007"
msgid "Access navigational systems\n"
msgstr "Accéder aux systèmes de navigation\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_008"
msgid "Sabotage engine systems\n"
msgstr "Saboter les systèmes de propulsion\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_009"
msgid "Gain control of bridge\n"
msgstr "Contrôler le pont\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_010"
msgid "Ship's shields have been lowered.\n"
msgstr "Boucliers du vaisseau baissés.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_011"
msgid "Hangar doors have been opened.\n"
msgstr "Portes du hangar ouvertes.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_012"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Elvis abattu.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_013"
msgid "Navigational information has been retrieved.\n"
msgstr "Infos de navigation récupérées.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_014"
msgid "Lift has been activated.\n"
msgstr "Ascenseur activé.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_015"
msgid "All hangar Skedar have been killed.\n"
msgstr "Skedars du hangar abattus.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_016"
msgid ""
"Outside, Joanna. Get the shields down and \n"
"we can help you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Joanna! Baisse les boucliers \n"
"et nous t'aiderons.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_017"
msgid "You've got to open the hangar doors so we can dock.\n"
msgstr "Ouvre les portes du hangar pour que l'on puisse accoster.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_018"
msgid "Okay, we're in. I'll meet you in the hangar.\n"
msgstr "OK. Nous y sommes. Je te retrouve dans le hangar.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_019"
msgid "Good to see you, Joanna.\n"
msgstr "Ca me fait plaisir de te voir, Joanna. \n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_020"
msgid "Take this - you should find it useful...\n"
msgstr "Prends ça. C'est utile, tu verras...\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_021"
msgid "Received AR34 assault rifle.\n"
msgstr "Fusil d'assaut AR34 obtenu.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_022"
msgid ""
"Time to head upwards. I'll take this lift; \n"
"you take the other one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il faut monter. Je prends cet ascenseur. \n"
"Prends l'autre.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_023"
msgid "Engines have been disabled.\n"
msgstr "Moteurs coupés.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_024"
msgid "Look out, Joanna! I think we've made them angry...\n"
msgstr "Attention Joanna! Ils sont en colère je crois...\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_025"
msgid "Bridge has been captured.\n"
msgstr "Pont capturé.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_026"
msgid ""
"You go on ahead, Jo. I'll secure the perimeter. \n"
"We'll meet up later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vas-y, Joanna. Je sécurise le périmètre. \n"
"On se retrouve plus tard.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_027"
msgid ""
"I've got to get those shields down to let Elvis \n"
"in. I need all the help I can get.\n"
msgstr ""
"Je dois abaisser les boucliers pour faire entrer \n"
"Elvis. J'ai besoin d'aide...\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_028"
msgid "Now only the hangar bay doors are in the way.\n"
msgstr "Seules les portes de hangar sont sur le chemin.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_029"
msgid "This machine contains the Skedar star maps.\n"
msgstr "Cette machine contient les cartes stellaires skedars.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_030"
msgid "If we control the bridge, then the ship is ours.\n"
msgstr "Si nous contrôlons le pont, le vaisseau sera à notre merci.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_031"
msgid "Time to head upwards...\n"
msgstr "Il est temps de monter...\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_032"
msgid "Oohhh... I'd better not be where I think I am.\n"
msgstr "Oohhh... Dites-moi que ce n'est pas vrai.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_033"
msgid ""
"And it's worse than that, my dear. Just look who you've got for company.\n"
msgstr "Et si. Regardez donc qui est avec vous, ma chère.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_034"
msgid ""
"You! I thought you'd managed to escape. We found no trace of you at all.\n"
msgstr "Vous! Vous ne vous êtes pas enfuie? Nous avions perdu votre trace...\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_035"
msgid ""
"You couldn't find me. But there was no hiding from the Skedar, as you and "
"Mr. Carrington just discovered.\n"
msgstr ""
"Leurrer les Skedars était plus difficile. Vous et Mr. Carrington avez pu "
"vous en rendre compte.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_036"
msgid ""
"This is it. Wait there! I'll make a distraction; it will give you a chance "
"to get out. Use it or we'll both die.\n"
msgstr ""
"Attendez ici! Je vais créer une diversion. Cela vous donnera l'occasion de "
"partir. Faites vite ou nous mourrons.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_037"
msgid "Why are you doing this, Cassandra?\n"
msgstr "Pourquoi faites-vous tout ça, Cassandra?\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_038"
msgid "The Skedar used me, Joanna. You are my best chance for revenge.\n"
msgstr "Les Skedars m'ont utilisée. Vous êtes ma seule chance de me venger.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_039"
msgid "Eeeeaaarrrrggghhh!!!\n"
msgstr "Aaaaaahhhhhhh!!!\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_040"
msgid ""
"Wow. That's the first time I've seen another planet from space. It's "
"beautiful.\n"
msgstr ""
"C'est la première fois que je vois une planète depuis l'espace... C'est "
"magnifique.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_041"
msgid "Hmmmm?\n"
msgstr "Hein?\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_042"
msgid "I don't... I don't believe it!\n"
msgstr "Je... Je ne le crois pas!\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_043"
msgid "Elvis? What is it?\n"
msgstr "Elvis? Qu'est-ce qu'il y a?\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_044"
msgid "Where are you going?\n"
msgstr "Où vas-tu?\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_045"
msgid "We have to get down to the surface! Follow me!\n"
msgstr "Nous devons descendre à la surface! Suis-moi!\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_046"
msgid "We have to get out of here!\n"
msgstr "Il faut sortir d'ici!\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_047"
msgid "Hangar doors locked - shields still active.\n"
msgstr "Portes hangar fermées - boucliers actifs.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_048"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_049"
msgid "Ammo depleted - consoles can't be destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Munitions épuisées - panneaux ne peuvent être détruits.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_050"
msgid "Obtain De Vries' necklace.\n"
msgstr "Obtenir collier de De Vries.\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_051"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries: \n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_052"
msgid "Necklace\n"
msgstr "Collier\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_053"
msgid "De Vries' necklace\n"
msgstr "Collier de De Vries\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_054"
msgid "Picked up De Vries' necklace.\n"
msgstr "Collier de De Vries obtenu.\n"
